{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRESH</strong> is a tactical first-person shooter built around instant teleportation between two parallel worlds \u2014 triggered at the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves, hide, deceive. Shift reality mid-fight. Victory comes not just from aim, but from awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse both worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting contrasts two realities:<br>a decaying, post-Soviet wasteland and a prosperous Russia of the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the geometry of both to flank, escape, ambush \u2014 or disappear entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree core modes: classic deathmatch, team deathmatch and bomb planting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique maps with layered, mirrored architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization of both characters and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you <strong>can accidentally split yourself in half</strong> \u2014 or do it to someone else</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual style inspired by Russian environments and atmosphere</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930090?t=1760260460","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930090?t=1760260460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930090/a74ded016b140e0a8a040e6bb53656ab6595e3eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760260460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930090/a74ded016b140e0a8a040e6bb53656ab6595e3eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760260460","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violence, blood, and dismemberment"},"demos":[{"appid":4081720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRESH</strong> is a tactical first-person shooter built around instant teleportation between two parallel worlds \u2014 triggered at the press of a button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your moves, hide, deceive. Shift reality mid-fight. Victory comes not just from aim, but from awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse both worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting contrasts two realities:<br>a decaying, post-Soviet wasteland and a prosperous Russia of the near future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the geometry of both to flank, escape, ambush \u2014 or disappear entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree core modes: classic deathmatch, team deathmatch and bomb planting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two unique maps with layered, mirrored architecture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization of both characters and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you <strong>can accidentally split yourself in half</strong> \u2014 or do it to someone else</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual style inspired by Russian environments and atmosphere</p></li></ul>","developers":["Vladislav Surin","Daniel Prol1xy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930090/4fbbab77643d8014bb3f52c9ee1f4da4cf5dbf8a/header.jpg?t=1760260460","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3930090/480283186/4d34fb7195e12156ad99c1d3284b